    {
      "id": "flkL69UeD",
      "draft": true,
      "fields": {
        "Title": "Scatmine Blu 92",
        "Slug": "fragments-scatmine-blu-92",
        "Content": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:flkL69UeD/cNjz4Zsot:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:flkL69UeD/cNjz4Zsot:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "This collection of limited edition “dis-figurative” bronze sculpture serves as commentary, speaking of the of the act of destruction which marks the history of our civilisation, reflecting on both our society and the persevering nature of man."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:flkL69UeD/cNjz4Zsot:1",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:flkL69UeD/cNjz4Zsot:1:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "There is a powerful philosophy that has driven this “Intentional Art”, an art form of social commentary purposed to encourage interaction, creating awareness of the issue and actively seeking to assist. Fragments stand as “Art for Life’s Sake”, highlighting a persistent danger that still affects post war populations today."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Gallery": "[\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QyUmA5h4QY35R13gLGHnvOHNOL4.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/apw1sQ8TFQeM3OkkQdY7G3MbrBA.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/yR5QLsfMl9vVUXYOEB8JZ7GBY.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/G2xQIIUEoV0mGq61tjSGYS6I.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/rNp6PkeGMYKxKedwBlEaS88M.jpg\"]",
