    {
      "id": "Jm_BR956K",
      "draft": true,
      "fields": {
        "Title": "Hornet M93",
        "Slug": "fragment-hornet-m93",
        "Content": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/cNjz4Zsot:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/cNjz4Zsot:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "These deconstructed sculptures are a fusion between the classical and the contemporary, representing our civilisation’s continuous cycle of war. Their names are not taken from history books, rather they denote types of landmines, and are referred to, by the artist, as ‘Intentional Art’, for within is found both a concept and a purpose."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/cNjz4Zsot:1",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/cNjz4Zsot:1:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "This work is meant to raise awareness of the effects of landmines and, in association with several charities, Fragments has funded landmine clearance in Vietnam and Kosovo, as well as mine field mapping in Angola and risk education in Afghanistan. These sculptures continue to support landmine clearance in Cambodia today in association with Mine Advisory Group, UK."
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextLineBreak",
                "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/cNjz4Zsot:1:1"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/cNjz4Zsot:1:2",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "These paradoxically beautiful figures stand triumphantly as symbols of survival and hope."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Gallery": "[\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/gPXnlvFuO8md1l8DInIwRtEGPo.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/WT3AKAyS5BqBA2sqWfshKRBUJw.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/16EkSH9sagYGrpM1gsgt6gSpsQ.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/DYNYQaJqiTR1uu0TFxqDCQhshk.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/VfTMClWoU1e2RcNXZBBZ9XnkRQ.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/EBmtD3utJ3f43Mjln3YdKtZpBbk.jpg\"]",
        "Content 2": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/wJV7Uqavi:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/wJV7Uqavi:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "The Fragments communicate an idea, a concept and a truth, the ultimate result would convey the demand by the audience for justice, and the need for them to lend assistance, for Fragments must deliver hope as well as information."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/wJV7Uqavi:1",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/wJV7Uqavi:1:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "The work must challenge the aesthetics of figurative and decorative art, and motivate action. This communication takes a step towards a political world and confronts the exploitation of the art in order to encourage positive action."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/wJV7Uqavi:2",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:Jm_BR956K/wJV7Uqavi:2:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "The exhibition and promotion of the work is inspired by the concept of activism; the notion that we can use art to inform and alter, to this end will actively promote a concept of positive social engagement. The aim of the exhibition is to launch socio-political commentary that speaks of both war as well as the surviving nature of man "
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Image 1": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/ryUHmcleI6ZUECBHn0p6ba1Ecw.jpg",
        "Image 2": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/55jJf5Xgha4JX8iuvhJLbDrmnog.jpg",
        "Image 3": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/dbHhBLAUGETLKt0fYKDsddtssw.jpg",
        "Image 4": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/u8VpM9jTwAAeClAz5UbrnghM.jpg",
        "Image 5": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/7JVyxKdTI7BO3KgsGfVFB0huGYM.jpg",
        "Image 6": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/zkNNgTP70IpQuL3axsdIH5nLdn0.jpg",
        "Image 7": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/9EKarJ12KEdLwSOEHXy3SMFSkCU.jpg",
        "Image 8": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/5YpcXBEmS2EGyQOQS5oEQCy95o.jpg",
        "Image 9": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/rsKcomjJNTSdRkyKWV52AETtmkM.jpg",
        "Image 10": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/sRyNTnhLQWMAwtTbsEp475O1Piw.jpg",
        "Image 11": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Wt4tWFMWw0NkKDoPAdQVvyh3Pt4.jpg",
        "Link": null,
        "id": null
      },
      "otherAttributes": {
        "draft": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f8womTtJl",
      "draft": true,
      "fields": {
        "Title": "Hamdy HAK-1",
        "Slug": "fragment-hamdy-hak-1",
        "Content": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:f8womTtJl/cNjz4Zsot:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:f8womTtJl/cNjz4Zsot:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "The aesthetic undertakings within this series of artwork is based on the idea of destruction and represent as much a crime against art itself as a crime against the human population represented. The act of destruction carried out on each of these pieces contradicts the principal upon which the creative spirit is based and flourishes. This series of work follows a divergence from beauty towards the dissonance of corroded figures, denying the glory of war and displaying the decay in our world."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Gallery": "[\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/VkzHZj9mFZ9HCRYWsGjGiNG9yQ.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/mC6JUWtjLo68Xr5V8vX7ZQyPgU.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/rE2Ven6dX3axOu3i8FkhdM4srL0.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/juvWfUIDrURKMXGAIp9UUH69ofM.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jE0SkrY7rmbcMCBA5ZsPFcq7sOg.jpg\"]",
        "Content 2": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:f8womTtJl/wJV7Uqavi:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:f8womTtJl/wJV7Uqavi:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "This body of works represent a turning point for the artist into an area of activist art. The offence of destruction has become an aesthetic endeavour within this series of works. Regarded as a defiant and desperate act, it is a form of derivative art that it this case can be considered as the pillage of an art form."
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "TextLineBreak",
                "id": "v:f8womTtJl/wJV7Uqavi:0:1"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:f8womTtJl/wJV7Uqavi:0:2",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Notwithstanding, the affirmative creative and aesthetic characteristics present within this series of sculpture provide a beautiful illustration of the redeeming quality for which humanity is known: the creative ability to rebuild civilizations upon the remnants of the past."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Image 1": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/LAbTflmrHvkFp71G5f07bWmvxnc.jpg",
        "Image 2": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/juvWfUIDrURKMXGAIp9UUH69ofM.jpg",
        "Image 3": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/jE0SkrY7rmbcMCBA5ZsPFcq7sOg.jpg",
        "Image 4": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/aAcTHV1xwIIYGiUrU1dzYPlnIfc.jpg",
        "Image 5": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/rE2Ven6dX3axOu3i8FkhdM4srL0.jpg",
        "Image 6": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/ZxomtmWIKTKDlvcSUsArOJWiBY.jpg",
        "Image 7": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/CvouM5chv6HtlvhRIiRLybQDdk.jpg",
        "Image 8": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/RGMS8gBY4FASiAqi9H9IxR9wyww.jpg",
        "Image 9": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/njwcyQG8DlXwpid4dopI9akPcU.jpg",
        "Image 10": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/5jSv853tpBq7QNHIORvxrQ9E8.jpg",
        "Image 11": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/YJuzCzbIHDfHtk4GjRPgaRJoHTQ.jpg",
        "Link": null,
        "id": null
      },
      "otherAttributes": {
        "draft": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "EVozPPEut",
      "draft": true,
      "fields": {
        "Title": "Apple P-40",
        "Slug": "apple-p-40",
        "Content": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:EVozPPEut/cNjz4Zsot:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextLineBreak",
                "id": "v:EVozPPEut/cNjz4Zsot:0:0"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:EVozPPEut/cNjz4Zsot:0:1",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "The inspiration for this series of fragmented sculpture is found within the archeological remnants of many ancient civilisations. The aesthetic properties relating to these artefacts have been cultivated by our society allowing the residual fragment to be appreciated as a complete work of art rather than just a damaged vestige thereof, yet the symbolic reference is found within the injury embodied in each piece."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:EVozPPEut/cNjz4Zsot:1",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:EVozPPEut/cNjz4Zsot:1:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "I have devoted my life to the pursuit of truth, beauty, and hope in figurative sculpture.  I work in clay which gives me a tactile form of expression and a means to push the boundaries of the human form. There is a certain truth in the composition and proportions of every piece. As well, I believe that where the works convey issues of social significance, I speak of a socio-political reality."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:EVozPPEut/cNjz4Zsot:2",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextLineBreak",
                "id": "v:EVozPPEut/cNjz4Zsot:2:0"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Gallery": "[\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/u6S67lc1Dtq8QK26cjOwiKhFPLw.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/sby4dZbiZNRKfRRtXDJt5zm6Ic.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/XD5jUo6S0bZZVQLF85KJMFcrw.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/bksJBFsuJC5XmHtDHz3l2iygyBw.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/yuwTPOls9vF4KwCJycxUIJ2Es9Y.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/sby4dZbiZNRKfRRtXDJt5zm6Ic.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Dn4xJEBNE5uvN1hYrWcBOL8Qs0.jpg\"]",
        "Content 2": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:EVozPPEut/wJV7Uqavi:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:EVozPPEut/wJV7Uqavi:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Within the Fragments collection, I set out to create a fusion of classical sculpture that pushes the limits of post-modern deconstruction. While these are not remnants from antiquity, there is an underlying classical reference to ancient notions of idealised beauty. My desire is to translate my art into a statement both humanistic and representational in an attempt to promote an insight into human values."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:EVozPPEut/wJV7Uqavi:1",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:EVozPPEut/wJV7Uqavi:1:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Speaking specifically of Fragments, I believe that within the human form our history is alive with both a vision of beauty and an opposite form of menacing historical truth."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Image 1": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/5Q9xMeYGia6MM6RpwjTmiXp6aY.jpg",
        "Image 2": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/zzLjyMli2SkAAhCLd198Rs0M.jpg",
        "Image 3": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/XiOzyWugx71YtC7ouVML50vpjA.jpg",
        "Image 4": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/sby4dZbiZNRKfRRtXDJt5zm6Ic.jpg",
        "Image 5": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Uidp7ptzmh7QPI5aHj2VJNrPc.jpg",
        "Image 6": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/EBoim893euglhUlwp3osTHrk.jpg",
        "Image 7": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Dn4xJEBNE5uvN1hYrWcBOL8Qs0.jpg",
        "Image 8": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/av7nLdtiTgBX1mJljwtoqtYI.jpg",
        "Image 9": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/yuwTPOls9vF4KwCJycxUIJ2Es9Y.jpg",
        "Image 10": null,
        "Image 11": null,
        "Link": null,
        "id": null
      },
      "otherAttributes": {
        "draft": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3aZAuyOm",
      "draft": true,
      "fields": {
        "Title": "Butterfly PFM 1",
        "Slug": "fragment-butterfly-pfm-1",
        "Content": [
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:s3aZAuyOm/cNjz4Zsot:0",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:s3aZAuyOm/cNjz4Zsot:0:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "The symbolic considerations involving the representation of the human form in a deteriorated or decaying condition could easily be seen to illustrate the perceived decline in our society and a deterioration of our social and political situations."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "id": "v:s3aZAuyOm/cNjz4Zsot:1",
            "attributes": {
              "tag": "p"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextRun",
                "id": "v:s3aZAuyOm/cNjz4Zsot:1:0",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "In many areas of society, we are experiencing heightened awareness of social disparity, fracture and discord as philosophical, religious and theological differences have become increasingly apparent. Society has always been fragmented between cultural, economic and racial differences and as our world becomes smaller these differences can become more evident."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Gallery": "[\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/iz8zrygXNqkjBOJ6fMUyj8jFm94.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0ha0qUb7PufE6fhC6mnQ8nPM8.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/fZkJo0HKQOwbhCMRPYvcgylMV1w.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/utsq8VNNkM5qWZPIq5ncTF6KIuU.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/lnvG35yAnJF3DhIhRYfEc5Z8PJQ.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/ReRCBzoQVIR6HT5rEsQwMgamcQo.jpg\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0Zld5E5p3t1v5QpmGgKGqoaAyA4.jpg\"]",
        "Content 2": null,
        "Image 1": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/ET3yiPQiAcZA67Ym8zkzlgPUMbo.jpg",
        "Image 2": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/sQcC8V1FdxMS147PENNgWk3QFs.jpg",
        "Image 3": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/y93sOtz10ocqUjxHEtWUdbruhg.jpg",
        "Image 4": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Vki44k8EAW5UJuunFwWhkU1s83A.jpg",
        "Image 5": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/M9i77RwFfwwtkvYOgNbqaLGrEA.jpg",
